When the user asks which stocks or ETFs to buy for long-term accumulation, or whether a named market/ticker is a true sale-off, follow the skill at `SKILL.md` in this repo.

Read **only** the files that router names after you detect MARKET (vn/us/uk/de/au) and MODE (equity / ai-semis / real-assets). Equity loads `lenses.md` with core; load `sizing.md` only when recommending an action. Do not load every `markets/*.md`. A Vietnam question must not load US/UK/DE/AU packs.
